The pipe: |&gt; or %&gt;%

We use the pipe to chain a series of operations.
For example if we want to select columns and then filter rows we chain like this:

\[ \mbox{original data }
\rightarrow \mbox{ select }
\rightarrow \mbox{ filter } \]

